{number: 147}
{title: God be with You}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C] God be with you till we [F] meet a-[C] gain;
By His counsels guide, up-[G7] hold you,
With His [C] sheep securely [F] fold you;
[C] God be with you [G7] till we meet a-[C] gain.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Till we [F] meet, till we [C] meet,
Till we meet at [G7] Jesus' feet;
Till we [C] meet, till we [F] meet,
[C] God be with you [G7] till we meet a-[C] gain.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C] God be with you till we [F] meet a-[C] gain;
'Neath His wings securely [G7] hide you,
Daily [C] manna still pro-[F] vide you;
[C] God be with you [G7] till we meet a-[C] gain.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C] God be with you till we [F] meet a-[C] gain;
When life's perils thick con-[G7] found you,
Put un-[C] failing arms a-[F] round you;
[C] God be with you [G7] till we meet a-[C] gain.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[C] God be with you till we [F] meet a-[C] gain;
Keep love's banner floating [G7] o'er you,
Smite death's [C] threatening wave be-[F] fore you;
[C] God be with you [G7] till we meet a-[C] gain.
{end_of_verse}
